menu "e32p: adc"

    config E32P_ADC_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_adc (oneshot ADC)"
        default n
        help
            Oneshot ADC facade with per-channel attenuation and optional
            line-fitting calibration to millivolts. One handle per ADC unit.
            Note: ADC2 cannot be read while Wi-Fi is active.

endmenu
